function Metric({label,value,note,icon:Icon,featured}){return <article className={'metric '+(featured?'featured':'')}><div><span>{label}</span><Icon size={19}/></div><strong>{value}</strong><small>{note}</small></article>}
function SearchBox({value,set,placeholder}){return <div className="search"><Search size={17}/><input aria-label={placeholder} placeholder={placeholder} value={value} onChange={e=>set(e.target.value)}/></div>}
function EventTable({events,onReceipt,onDelete,canDelete}){return <Table head={['Date','Record','Section','Amount','Action']} rows={events.map(e=>[e.business_date,<div className="activity-description"><strong>{e.description}</strong><small>{kinds[e.kind]||e.kind} · {short(e.id)}</small></div>,<Badge>{e.division}</Badge>,e.amount>0?money(e.amount):'—',<div className="row-actions"><button className="text-button" onClick={()=>onReceipt(e)}>View</button>{canDelete&&<button className="text-button danger" onClick={()=>onDelete(e.id)}>Delete</button>}</div>])}/>}
